{"id": "DeE57zWP038", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"AUDIT\" to get this Free AI skill to fix security holes in your vibe coded apps.\n\nCloudflare just open sourced an AI skill that finds the security holes in your vibe coded apps.\n\nAnd it's completely free.\n\nThey originally built it for themselves.\n\nIt found over 7,000 security issues in their own codebase.\n\nAnd it has already crossed 22k stars on GitHub.\n\nYou just install it into your Claude Code.\n\nAnd it first maps out your entire app.\n\nThen it sends a team of AI agents to hunt through it.\n\nFrom your logins, database, and APIs.\n\nTo even prompt injection if your app uses AI.\n\nEvery bug they find is handed over to a separate agent.\n\nWhose only job is to disprove it.\n\nSo only the real issues make it through.\n\nAnd finally, it gives you a detailed report.\n\nWith every verified issue, along with exactly how to fix it.\n\nThink of it like hiring a security team that checks its own work.\n\nMost scanners hand you a long list of maybe problems.\n\nThis one only shows you the ones it can actually prove.\n\nVibe coded apps ship fast, but security often gets skipped.\n\nRun it before you launch so you catch the holes first.\n\n#vibecoding #aicoding #claudecode #cloudfare #aisecurity", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1791126049, "like_count": 6821, "comment_count": 5991, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1139238601768863a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.807, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNKzDc4XU4BxQKReG-_NI8r0USkilbRonZrpH8LXQDWhlguPixP82Qe4VtGP-aJdvKRs2zib3cwa_3iTHZrXGQ09G2kG8cJxnrbf90.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Adq-okEeLbIctTGmHVzX-zm0HsgTI-74Dx7EdGDXhvS7cOueZ6z3oFqheQUADFGvhd8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-2.